$$
 H_{S,c}=\max_{0\le z\le8}
       \sum_{w:\,\operatorname{cell}_S(w)=c}f_Y(w,z).
$$

Summing these maxima over the cells gives 544 for the empty schedule and every singleton. For pairs, the complete list of sums is

